OL,3,GNEWSAAlisha Samuels murder suspect
OL,4,Aattacked in prison
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was charged with murdering a
OL,7,F26-year-old woman in Manchester has
OL,8,Fbeen attacked in prison.
OL,10,FLawrence Johnson, 26, of Dorking
OL,11,FAvenue, was held on remand at HMP
OL,12,FLiverpool after being charged with the
OL,13,Fmurder of Alisha Samuels, who was found
OL,14,Fdead in Newton Heath on 15 October.
OL,16,FFootage seen by the BBC, thought to
OL,17,Fhave been filmed from within the prison
OL,18,Fat the weekend, shows Johnson being
OL,19,Fattacked in a cell. In the video,
OL,20,Finmates can be heard saying: "Bro,
OL,21,Fyou're getting chopped up. Sit down,
OL,22,Fbro. Smash him up."
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
